# ROOFCAT: one continuous town of four areas of thirteen screens plus the
# arena, about nine minutes of scrolling. Every screen has tiers above the
# lowest roofs (the top ones are the safe way through), foes stand where
# they can stand, and the town is busy: over 350 foes written in. Five
# hidden letter spots, four lanterns at fixed places, two bonus stretches
# that are a solid mass of snacks (and no snacks anywhere else).
game roofcat
wait 5
cheat area 0 1
expect world_len == 53
expect chunk_errors == 0
expect misplaced == 0
expect scroll_seconds >= 540
expect scroll_seconds <= 570
expect tier_rows_x10 >= 30
expect secrets == 5
expect placed_lanterns == 4
expect bonus_snacks >= 250
expect stray_snacks == 0
expect placed_foes >= 350
# the firecrackers come about halfway (screens 24-27 of 52)
expect first_cracker_screen >= 22
expect first_cracker_screen <= 27
